self.KB_CONTENT["card:784189"]={"id":"card:784189","ty":"card","sourceId":"784189","title":"『資產請購單憑證』中的『FAX NO/Email Address (C36)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"採購單","keywords":["採購單","憑證","資產","尚未"],"y":"other","answer":"* 尚未購買『FAX&Email處理系統』(FEP)，則FAX/Email需隱藏。* 可複選 (icon)或[F2]片語資料查詢。※ 資產採購單憑證","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:784398"]={"id":"card:784398","ty":"card","sourceId":"784398","title":"『財稅簽差異比較表』中的『選擇資產類別 (MB006)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"資產","keywords":["資產","類別","比較"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可點選(icon)或[F2]資產類別查詢，以查詢欲列印何項資產類別的資料。* 此欄位空白表示全部。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
