self.KB_CONTENT["field:781850"]={"id":"field:781850","ty":"field","sourceId":"781850","title":"品號屬性","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"工程品號資料建立","code":"MI009","answer":"* 為元件品號之屬性為P.採購件、M.自製件、S.託外加工件、Y.虛設件、F.Feature件及O.Option件。* 若主件已為Feature/Option件，則元件不可同為Feature/Option件。","file":"fields.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["field:757798"]={"id":"field:757798","ty":"field","sourceId":"757798","title":"採購數量","ver":"iGP","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"分批請購資料維護","code":"","answer":"* 來源為請購單的請購數量，可再調整。","file":"fields.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["field:752425"]={"id":"field:752425","ty":"field","sourceId":"752425","title":"部門","ver":"iGP","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"分錄底稿維護作業","code":"TB006","answer":"* [F2]部門資料檔查詢已設定之部門資料，並自動顯示部門名稱於後。","file":"fields.jsonl"};
